 nontoken creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {G}{U}. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that creature.", 'You may choose new targets for target instant or sorcery spell. Then copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', "Your opponents can't search libraries.\nIf an opponent would begin an extra turn, that player skips that turn instead.", '[+1]: Untap two target lands.\n[−1]: Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.\n[−4]: Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', '{1}, {T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', "{1}, {T}: Acorn Catapult deals 1 damage to any target. That permanent's controller or that player creates a 1/1 green Squirrel creature token.", '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{U}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{B}.', "{1}{B}: Exile target card from an opponent's graveyard. If no cards are in that graveyard, flip Nezumi Graverobber.", '{1}{R}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn.\n{1}{W}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{2}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{2}: Squallmonger deals 1 damage to each creature with flying and each player. Any player may activate this ability.', "{2}{W}: Tap target creature.\n{2}{U}: Counter target activated ability. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)", '{2}{W}: Target player gains 1 life.\n{2}{B}: Each player loses 1 life.', '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{4}, {T}: Put a fate counter on target permanent.\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Oblivion Stone: Destroy each nonland permanent without a fate counter on it, then remove all fate counters from all permanents.', '{4}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\n{4}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target nonblack creature.', '{G}: Exile target card from a graveyard. If it was a creature card, put a +1/+1 counter on Scavenging Ooze and you gain 1 life.', '{R}: Chartooth Cougar gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\nMountaincycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Mountain card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add {C}.\nMorph {2} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Dreadship Reef.\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Dreadship Reef: Add X mana in any combination of {U} and/or {B}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Fungal Reaches.\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Fungal Reaches: Add X mana in any combination of {R} and/or {G}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Molten Slagheap.\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Molten Slagheap: Add X mana in any combination of {B} and/or {R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{3}{B}{G}: Until end of turn, Svogthos, the Restless Tomb becomes a black and green Plant Zombie creature with "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard." It\'s still a land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Each player gains control of all creatures they own.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Dreamstone Hedron: Draw three cards.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G}.\nForestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "{T}: Return two target cards from an opponent's graveyard to their hand. Destroy target attacking creature.", '{T}: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', "{W}, Sacrifice Soul Snare: Exile target creature that's attacking you or a planeswalker you control.", "{X}{U}{R}, {T}: Nin, the Pain Artist deals X damage to target creature. That creature's controller draws X cards."]
